<title>RUSSIA: Russia March money supply rises to 307.6 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia March money supply rises to 307.6 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian M2 money supply rose to 307.6 trillion roubles on March 1 from 297.4 trillion a month earlier, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN MONEY SUPPLY	   Mar 1     Feb 1     Mar 1 1996</p>
<p>    M2 volume			  307.6     297.4     229.2</p>
<p>    cash in circulation (MO)     102.0	96.3	80.4</p>
<p>NOTES - Volumes in trillion roubles.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
